---

<BaseLayout
  title="rakku — koleksi favorit pribadi"
  acc="home"
  page="home"
>
  <div class="ticker" aria-label="Ticker">
    <div class="tick-track">
      {
        Array.from({ length: 2 }).map((_, halfIndex) => (
          <div class="half" aria-hidden={halfIndex === 1 ? 'true' : undefined}>
            {
              tickerItems.map((item) => (
                <span>
                  <b class={item.className}>{item.label}</b>
                  {item.value ? ` ${item.value}` : ''}
                </span>
              ))
            }
          </div>
        ))
      }
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="mast wrap">
    <div>
      <p class="kicker rv">
        <span class="live-dot"></span>
        KATALOG PRIBADI — PEMBARUAN 09·11·2026
      </p>

      <h1 class="mast-title rv">
        Satu rak berisi
        <span id="flipWord" class="flip" style="color: var(--c-listen)">lagu</span>
        favoritku.
      </h1>

      <p class="mast-sub rv">
        Kumpulan hal-hal kecil yang bikin betah: trek yang kuputar ulang, film
        yang bikin susah move on, sampai manga yang kutunggu tiap minggu.
        Semua dipilih manual — <em>nggak ada algoritma di sini</em>.
      </p>

      <div class="mast-links rv">
        <a class="arrow-link" href="/listen" style="--alc: var(--c-listen)">
          buka rak dengerin <span>→</span>
        </a>
        <a class="arrow-link" href="/watchlist" style="--alc: var(--c-watch)">
          lihat watchlist <span>→</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="stack rv" data-stagger>
      {
        stickers.map((sticker) => (
          <figure class="sticker">
            <img src={sticker.img} alt={sticker.title} width="300" height="300" loading="lazy" />
            <figcaption class="cap">
              <span>{sticker.title}</span>
              <span>{sticker.status}</span>
            </figcaption>
          </figure>
        ))
      }
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="ledger wrap rv" data-stagger>
    {
      ledgerItems.map((item) => (
        <span class={item.className}>
          <i class="ldot" style={`background:${item.color}`}></i>
          {item.label}
        </span>
      ))
    }
  </div>

  <section>
    <div class="sec-head wrap">
      <span class="no">01 /</span>
      <h2>Baru Ditambahkan</h2>
      <span class="rule"></span>
      <a class="more" href="#rak">rak lengkap ↓</a>
    </div>

    <div class="recent wrap" data-stagger>
      {
        recentItems.map((item) => (
          <a class={`row rv ${item.type}`} href={item.href}>
            <span class="idx">{item.idx}</span>
            <img src={item.img} alt={item.title} width="54" height="54" loading="lazy" />
            <span class="t">
              <strong>{item.title}</strong>
              <span>{item.sub}</span>
            </span>
            <span class={`chip ${item.type}`}>{item.chip}</span>
            <time>{item.date}</time>
            <span class="go">→</span>
          </a>
        ))
      }
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="rak" class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <span class="no">02 /</span>
      <h2>Buka per Rak</h2>
      <span class="rule"></span>
    </div>

    <nav class="doors" data-stagger>
      {
        doors.map((door) => (
          <a class="door rv" href={door.href} style={`--dc:${door.color}`}>
            <span class="d-no">{door.no}</span>
            <span class="d-name">{door.name}</span>
            <span class="d-count">{door.count}</span>
            <span class="d-go">→</span>
          </a>
        ))
      }
    </nav>
  </section>

  <aside class="note wrap rv">
    <p>
      “Cara kurasinya sederhana: kalau sebuah judul kuputar, kutonton, atau
      kumainkan lebih dari tiga kali tanpa disuruh — otomatis masuk rak.
      Nggak ada syarat lain.”
    </p>
    <p class="sig">— pemilik rak, ditulis sambil hujan-hujanan ☕</p>
  </aside>
</BaseLayout>